And yes, the v1.9 design we were converging on is:

Browser Access Layer

CDP host/port configurable in mmrc_config.json

/json/version probe

Playwright verification

Chromium executable detection + manual fallback

isolated QuackSink browser profile

startup backoff/polling

attach/verify rather than blindly launching

Relay viewport

Fan-Out resets the display viewport to the top

absolutely no mutation of FIFO/message state

Session resilience

deferred heap-based timeout handling

disconnect detection

Playwright cleanup

recovery when the launched/attached tab disappears

